# Raw exports from external systems may embed secrets — only sanitized copies are tracked
# (see AGENTS.md, Key Conventions)
*_raw.*
**/raw/

# Generated site — view of items/, built by helpers/build_site.py; never edit or commit
/_site/

# Wrangler local build cache — regenerated on every `wrangler deploy`
/bot/.wrangler/

# Python bytecode cache — regenerated whenever helpers/*.py is imported
__pycache__/

# Local-only task view folders — uncomment when the A2 organ is built (see GROWTH.md A2)
#/open/
#/done/
#/deferred/
